       <h1>Netflix veteran Emily Feingold appointed Disney EVP of Communications</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Former Netflix executive Emily Feingold has been appointed as the new Executive Vice President of Communications at The Walt Disney Co. In this senior leadership role, Feingold will oversee media relations, financial and technology communications, as well as enterprise editorial and brand messaging.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-06/netflix-veteran-emily-feingold-appointed-disney-evp-of-commu.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Feingold joins Disney following a nine-year tenure at Netflix, from which she departed five months ago. Her transition into this high-level position marks a significant addition to Disney’s executive communications team, where she will be responsible for steering the company's internal and external corporate messaging strategies across its various business sectors.</p>
