    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/tech">tech</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="tech">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">TECH</span> · The Verge · 2026-11-06 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Shure MV7 Plus Microphone Discounted by $50</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#tech</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Shure MV7 Plus, a popular USB microphone featuring a USB-C port and customizable LED panel, is currently on sale for $255 at major retailers including Amazon, Guitar Center, and Shure. This price represents a nearly $50 discount from its standard $299 retail cost.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-06/shure-mv7-plus-microphone-discounted-by-50.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Designed for podcasters and streamers, the MV7 Plus offers features like auto-leveling and denoising to ensure high-quality audio. The microphone includes both XLR and USB-C outputs, allowing for versatile connections to computers or professional audio interfaces, with bundle options including a desktop stand also available.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is accurate, concise, and correctly reflects the pricing and features mentioned in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/1028846/shure-mv7-plus-podcasting-streaming-mic-deal-sale" rel="noopener">The Verge</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
