      <ul><li><a href="https://thebetterindia.com/wildlife/diwali-pet-safety-protect-street-dogs-community-animals-12789590" rel="noopener">The Better India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
