       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">SPORTS</span> · NDTV Sports · 2026-11-06 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>WWE Expected to Announce WrestleMania 43 Dates at Crown Jewel</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#sports</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>WWE is expected to announce the official dates for WrestleMania 43 during its Crown Jewel broadcast in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, on November 7. Reports indicate the company is targeting April 10 and 11, 2027, for the two-night event, which will be the first WrestleMania held outside North America. TKO President Mark Shapiro recently described the risk of relocating the event as minimal.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-06/wwe-expected-to-announce-wrestlemania-43-dates-at-crown-jewe.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>However, regional uncertainty due to the ongoing conflict in the Middle East could potentially delay the announcement. Despite these concerns, internal sources maintain that WWE intends to reveal the 2027 schedule while the company is currently in Riyadh.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively synthesizes the information from the source text and the provided external context.</p>
